    "detailed_description": "<strong>Pixel Quest: Survivor</strong> is an action roguelite with unique characters and classes, where you defeat hordes of enemies and face different bosses while improving your skills, brave alone or in a group of up to 4 friends. Defeat your enemies, collect their souls, collect artifacts and improve their stats, and most importantly, survive!<br><br>With elements of RPG and roguelite-style bullet hell, <strong>Pixel Quest: Survivor</strong> offers a challenging and fun game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/338cbb4768bc5f7fa57cc7432ad5ecad.avif?t=1729304213\" width=544 height=90 /></span><li>Use unique characters with their own skills kit to face your enemies<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/6779b87747c107f9aa0e00a6a54579a3.poster.avif?t=1729304213\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/6779b87747c107f9aa0e00a6a54579a3.webm?t=1729304213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/6779b87747c107f9aa0e00a6a54579a3.mp4?t=1729304213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/66b86f88be87f3f8e003838695a6db3e.avif?t=1729304213\" width=544 height=90 /></span><br></li><li>Face a horde of enemies with your friends up to 4 people online<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/934e6bbc258864969bb9e1ec34711420.poster.avif?t=1729304213\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/934e6bbc258864969bb9e1ec34711420.webm?t=1729304213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/934e6bbc258864969bb9e1ec34711420.mp4?t=1729304213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/058ae8fa93db3db49b0ca65f5a6edf48.avif?t=1729304213\" width=544 height=90 /></span><br></li><li>Choose from different skills and create your own ways to play<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/dda3a4e902cc70bd41b593baebe0fc8b.poster.avif?t=1729304213\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/dda3a4e902cc70bd41b593baebe0fc8b.webm?t=1729304213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/dda3a4e902cc70bd41b593baebe0fc8b.mp4?t=1729304213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/cc1f74ed1d970fc2f94b2bde9e0689a6.avif?t=1729304213\" width=544 height=90 /></span><br></li><li>Create stronger versions of your skills to assist you in your battles<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/c5b29015730841e66092d5f7960d784a.poster.avif?t=1729304213\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880170/extras/c5